# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only, never published: private research vault, throwaway spike, and
# internal docs (deploy runbook + the design/spec/red-team "factory" artifacts).
# Kept on disk for local reference; scrubbed from git tracking + history so the
# repo can be open-sourced without exposing private notes, source rulebooks, or
# the internal process. (Source rulebooks under vault/ were never redistributable
# anyway — copyrighted — and now the whole vault stays local.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
